---
layout: base.njk
title: "Ahmedabad Doctors Directory | DHS Multispecialty Hospital"
description: "Ahmedabad's DHS Multispecialty Hospital doctor directory: browse specialists in orthopedics, cardiology, neurosurgery & more. Book your consultation today."
canonical: "https://www.dhshospitals.com/doctors/"
breadcrumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { name: "Doctors", url: "/doctors/" }
activePage: "doctors"
---

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Find a Doctor</h1>
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Find a Doctor</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-bottom:40px">Our team of experienced and dedicated medical professionals is here to provide you with the best possible care.</p>
    <div class="doctors-grid">
      {% for doc in doctors %}
      <a href="/doctors/{{ doc.slug }}/" class="doctor-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
        <img src="{{ doc.image }}" alt="{{ doc.name }} — {{ doc.specialty }} at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="300" height="250">
        <div class="doctor-card-body">
          <h3>{{ doc.name }}</h3>
          <div class="qualification">{{ doc.qualification }}</div>
          <div class="specialty">{{ doc.specialty }}</div>
          {% if doc.role %}<div style="font-size:.75rem;color:var(--accent-gold);font-weight:600;margin-top:4px">{{ doc.role }}</div>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
